-## Current-stage boundary
+## Prepared environment
+
+The environment stage supplies the official ZooKeeper 3.4.4 release archive,
+a pinned Zulu OpenJDK 6u119 archive, `Dockerfile`, `compose.yml`, and the
+ZooKeeper 3.4.4 Log4j 1.x/server configuration. Archive hashes are recorded in
+`dist/SHA256SUMS` and are checked again inside the image build.
+
+Build the image from this directory with:
+
+```sh
+docker compose -f compose.yml build
+```
+
+Compose defaults to host UID/GID 1000. A host using different IDs should set
+`HOST_UID` and `HOST_GID`. `ZK_DATA_DIR`, `ZK_LOG_DIR`, and `ZK_RESULT_DIR`
+select the host bind-mount directories and should point at new, unique attempt
+directories when experiments are eventually run. The non-root entrypoint sets
+umask 022 and refuses mounts that are not readable, writable, and traversable.
 
-Only the specification files were added at this stage. No Docker environment,
-Java reproduction or fault-injection source, build output, or experiment
-attempt is to be created or run.
+After an attempt has fully stopped and its output has been captured, invoke
+`scripts/protect-artifacts.sh` separately on its directory beneath `logs/` and
+on its file or directory beneath `result/`. It makes regular files read-only
+and directories readable/traversable but non-writable. It refuses paths
+outside those two trees and refuses symbolic links.
+
+This environment stage does not add reproduction/fault-injection Java source
+and does not start the server or run an experiment.
diff --git a/compose.yml b/compose.yml
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..ba3737570f48b415930e8e7d81ff875432cd6133
--- /dev/null
+++ b/compose.yml
@@ -0,0 +1,37 @@
+name: zookeeper-1560
+
+services:
+  zookeeper:
+    image: zookeeper-1560:3.4.4-jdk6
+    build:
+      context: .
+      dockerfile: Dockerfile
+    platform: linux/amd64
+    user: "${HOST_UID:-1000}:${HOST_GID:-1000}"
+    init: true
+    environment:
+      JMXDISABLE: "true"
+      ZOO_LOG_DIR: /logs
+      ZOO_LOG4J_PROP: INFO,CONSOLE,ROLLINGFILE
+      SERVER_JVMFLAGS: -Xms128m -Xmx512m -Djava.io.tmpdir=/data/tmp
+    volumes:
+      - type: bind
+        source: ${ZK_DATA_DIR:-./data}
+        target: /data
+      - type: bind
+        source: ${ZK_LOG_DIR:-./logs}
+        target: /logs
+      - type: bind
+        source: ${ZK_RESULT_DIR:-./result}
+        target: /result
+    ports:
+      - "127.0.0.1:${ZK_CLIENT_PORT:-2181}:2181"
+    cpus: 1.0
+    mem_limit: 1g
+    stop_grace_period: 10s
+    healthcheck:
+      test: ["CMD-SHELL", "/opt/zookeeper/bin/zkServer.sh status /opt/zookeeper/conf/zoo.cfg >/dev/null 2>&1"]
+      interval: 2s
+      timeout: 5s
+      retries: 15
+      start_period: 5s
diff --git a/config/log4j.properties b/config/log4j.properties
new file mode 100644
index 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000..41c1b2784f98f83ae28e6e5e1267f463d6e61d86
--- /dev/null
+++ b/config/log4j.properties
@@ -0,0 +1,32 @@
+# ZooKeeper 3.4.4 uses Log4j 1.x. Values on the first six lines may be
+# overridden by the system properties set by the bundled zkServer.sh.
+zookeeper.root.logger=INFO, CONSOLE, ROLLINGFILE
+zookeeper.console.threshold=INFO
+zookeeper.log.dir=/logs
+zookeeper.log.file=zookeeper.log
+zookeeper.log.threshold=DEBUG
+zookeeper.tracelog.dir=/logs
+zookeeper.tracelog.file=zookeeper_trace.log
+
+log4j.rootLogger=${zookeeper.root.logger}
+
+log4j.appender.CONSOLE=org.apache.log4j.ConsoleAppender
+log4j.appender.CONSOLE.Threshold=${zookeeper.console.threshold}
+log4j.appender.CONSOLE.layout=org.apache.log4j.PatternLayout
+log4j.appender.CONSOLE.layout.ConversionPattern=%d{ISO8601} [myid:%X{myid}] - %-5p [%t:%C{1}@%L] - %m%n
+
+log4j.appender.ROLLINGFILE=org.apache.log4j.RollingFileAppender
+log4j.appender.ROLLINGFILE.Threshold=${zookeeper.log.threshold}
+log4j.appender.ROLLINGFILE.File=${zookeeper.log.dir}/${zookeeper.log.file}
+log4j.appender.ROLLINGFILE.Append=true
+log4j.appender.ROLLINGFILE.MaxFileSize=10MB
+log4j.appender.ROLLINGFILE.MaxBackupIndex=10
+log4j.appender.ROLLINGFILE.layout=org.apache.log4j.PatternLayout
+log4j.appender.ROLLINGFILE.layout.ConversionPattern=%d{ISO8601} [myid:%X{myid}] - %-5p [%t:%C{1}@%L] - %m%n
+
+log4j.appender.TRACEFILE=org.apache.log4j.FileAppender
+log4j.appender.TRACEFILE.Threshold=TRACE
+log4j.appender.TRACEFILE.File=${zookeeper.tracelog.dir}/${zookeeper.tracelog.file}
+log4j.appender.TRACEFILE.Append=true
+log4j.appender.TRACEFILE.layout=org.apache.log4j.PatternLayout
+log4j.appender.TRACEFILE.layout.ConversionPattern=%d{ISO8601} [myid:%X{myid}] - %-5p [%t:%C{1}@%L][%x] - %m%n
diff --git a/config/zoo.cfg b/config/zoo.cfg
new file mode 100644
